{"id":"xianzhu-p0112","name":"刘禅","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-36e16d5d0fc6a1c96f0d","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"十二年，亮卒，后主素服发哀三日","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":215,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-3a928749e74bcaf78565","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-4d265048ad192f75537e","layer":"original","quote":"亮卒","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-f46c6578f33e567665bf","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-d6e88dadedcbc541c974","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《益部耆旧杂记》曰：“诸葛亮于武功病笃。后主遣福省侍，遂因咨以国家大计。福往具宣圣旨，听亮所言；至别去数日，忽驰思未尽其意，遂却骑驰还见亮。亮语福曰：‘孤知君还意。近日言语，虽弥日，有所不尽，更来（一）〔求〕决耳。君所问者，公琰其宜也。’福谢：‘前实失不咨请公：如公百年后，谁可任大事者；故辄还耳。乞复请，蒋琬之后，谁可任者？’亮曰：‘文伟可以继之。’又复问其次，亮不答。福还，奉使称旨。福为人精识果锐，敏于从政。子骧，字叔龙。亦有名，官至尚书郎、广汉太守。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c6aee412dd18dafa1749","start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-2899d76b2c3e5a805223","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-01cfa9a0573644b0deda","layer":"original","quote":"亮卒于敌庭","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-89291fa3e519e1471949","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-01cfa9a0573644b0deda","layer":"original","quote":"周在家闻问〖7〗，即便奔赴〖8〗；寻有诏书禁断，惟周以速行得达","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O028","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-f14b2099cf9ad715d98a","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，亮卒于渭滨。征西大将军魏延，与丞相长史杨仪争权，不和〖17〗，举兵相攻，延败走，斩延首；仪率诸军还成都。大赦。以左将军吴壹为车骑将军，假节督汉中。以丞相留府长史蒋琬为尚书令〖18〗，总统国事。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-3ecc9d803bca1df2a671","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-b11ee1fc4d2478105ae4","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖4〗，亮卒于武功，军退还","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0048","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-73a954b5e120f7b079b1","layer":"original","quote":"亮卒","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":2,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-8c21bf5035a1629efb0d","layer":"original","quote":"其年八月，亮疾病；卒于军，时年五十四。﹝四﹞及军退，宣王案行其营垒处所〖7〗，曰：“天下奇才也！”﹝五﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p040-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-1216e95054a2916f1197","layer":"pei","quote":"《汉晋春秋》曰：“亮卒于郭氏坞。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b775a3de637528356864","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p041-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-2fb3d5322da15a875d81","layer":"pei","quote":"《晋阳秋》曰：“有星赤而芒角，自东北，西南流，投于亮营；三投再还，往大还小。俄而亮卒。”","attribution":"《晋阳秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":310,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b775a3de637528356864","start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
